      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1.  Jobs are isolated. A file written in job A does not exist in job B unless you upload an artifact.",
      "originalText": "1.  Jobs are isolated. A file written in job A does not exist in job B unless you upload an artifact.",
